<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates drop, 6-mth rises.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates drop, 6-mth rises.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) dropped one basis point for the one- and three-month maturities and rose one basis point for six months, the National Bank of Hungary said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.28 percent and the three-month rate at 21.14 percent, while the six-month rate was fixed at 21.02 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
